# Smart Route Optimization & 'Whole Road' Analysis

This plan outlines the implementation of a comprehensive "Whole Road" analysis and a smart route optimizer that actively avoids high-pothole areas by requesting new paths from the mapping service.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Lane Optimization**: I will implement logic to determine if a pothole is on the **left or right side** of your path. The app will then provide "Lane Guidance" (e.g., "Stay in the Right Lane") to help you navigate around obstacles within the same road.
> **Scan Radius (70m)**: As confirmed, the scan will cover the entire width of the road to ensure we catch all lane-specific hazards.



## Proposed Changes

### Map Screen Component

#### [MODIFY] [map_screen.dart](file:///c:/ssdd/flutter/lib/map_screen.dart)

- **'Whole Road' & Lane Scan**:
    - Increase search radius to **70m**.
    - For each pothole, determine its "Lane" (Left or Right) relative to the route polyline using cross-product math.
    - Add `lanePreference` to the route evaluation (scoring routes based on how many "unavoidable" full-width potholes they have).

- **Smart Optimization & Lane Guidance**:
    - **Method `_getLaneGuidance()`**: A new method to look 100m ahead and suggest the safest lane based on upcoming pothole positions.
    - **Optimization**: Use `avoid_polygons` to dodge large clusters, and the "Lane Guidance" for individual potholes within a road.



- **UI Updates**:
    - **Enhanced Nav Pill**: Add a "Stay Left/Right" indicator to the top navigation chip when a pothole is ahead in a specific lane.
    - **✨ Smart Optimize Button**: A prominent button in the route picker to trigger full path avoidance.
    - **Route Cards**: Show "Smoothness Health" and "Best Lane" information.



